# Ctrl+X cuts a task with its note and P pastes it above the focused block.
file <<END
Reading:
	- Dune
		Great worldbuilding
	- Neuromancer
	- Hyperion
END
keys j <C-x>
see ▌   - Neuromancer
keys G P
see ▌   - Dune
quit
saved <<END
Reading:
	- Neuromancer
	- Dune
		Great worldbuilding
	- Hyperion
END
